- LOCAL_HOT_PATH write: internal\api\telemetry_handler.go:466 calls h.signalStore.Update(vehicleID, signals). internal\signal\store.go:51-78 merges non-nil/non-invalid values into the per-process map and stamps each value with time.Now().UTC().
- CROSS_POD_READ mirror write: internal\api\telemetry_handler.go:475-478 launches safeGo("redis-signal-cache") and calls h.redisCache.Update(redisCtx, vehicleID, redisCopy). internal\signal\redis_cache.go:38-77 writes one Redis HSET key per vehicle and refreshes TTL.
- Redis HSET shape today: internal\signal\redis_cache.go:21 documents key "vehicle:{vehicleID}:signals"; internal\signal\redis_cache.go:43 uses fmt.Sprintf("vehicle:%d:signals", vehicleID); fields are signal names; values are encodeSignalValue(val) strings from internal\signal\redis_cache.go:138-164.
- Redis stores values only today: internal\signal\redis_cache.go:59 appends name and encodeSignalValue(val). There is no per-field timestamp in Redis HSET. Freshness exists only in local internal\signal.Store Value.Timestamp at internal\signal\store.go:19-22 and in durable signal_log rows.
